@baseUrl = {{$dotenv BE_BASE_URL}}/api
@jwtToken = {{$dotenv JWT_TOKEN}}

### Check-in status of the signed-in account (streak, week, today's gift)
GET {{baseUrl}}/fun/checkin
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Open today's gift (once per day)
POST {{baseUrl}}/fun/checkin/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Report a wrong question (3 reports hide it)
POST {{baseUrl}}/quiz/questions/1/report
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "wrong_answer", "note": "Đáp án đúng phải là B" }


### Send the browser id (risk score of the sticker game)
POST {{baseUrl}}/fun/device
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "deviceId": "7f3c1e2a-9b4d-4e0f-8a1c-2d3b4c5d6e7f" }

### Sticker album, welcome pack and offers
GET {{baseUrl}}/stickers
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Offer a trade: give a duplicate (giveId) for a sticker of the same rarity you lack (wantId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/stickers/offers
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "toPhone": "0912345678", "giveId": 1, "wantId": 2 }

### Answer an offer
POST {{baseUrl}}/stickers/offers/1/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/stickers/offers/1/decline
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Full-set reward of one collection (once per person and collection)
POST {{baseUrl}}/stickers/set-reward
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "collectionId": 1 }


### Balance and last movements of the game currency (Leo Xu)
GET {{baseUrl}}/fun/coins
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Leo Xu ledger, paged (the page /fun/coins)
GET {{baseUrl}}/fun/coins/history?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### My achievement banners
GET {{baseUrl}}/achievements?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Public view of a banner (what the share page shows)
GET {{baseUrl}}/achievements/abcdefghjkmn

### Count a share press (owner only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/achievements/abcdefghjkmn/share
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Khám phá: feed, like, comment, report
GET {{baseUrl}}/explore?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/explore/1/like
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/explore/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"body": "Mẹo hay quá!"}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/explore/comments/1/report
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "Quảng cáo"}


### Plan 15: the Leo Xu shop (catalog with prices and today's limits, what can be sold, balance, energy)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shop
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Buy a quiz item (mult2, mult3, shield, topic, fifty, community, time, swap)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shop/buy
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "key": "fifty" }

### Buy a training pack: pack_level and pack_topic_level need difficulty 1..5, pack_topic does not
POST {{baseUrl}}/shop/buy
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "key": "pack_level", "difficulty": 4 }

### Refill energy (max 3 a day, never above the max)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shop/buy
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "key": "energy" }

### Sticker chests: chest_normal (30 xu) and chest_rare (90 xu, rare or epic for sure)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shop/buy
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "key": "chest_rare" }

### Sell a duplicate sticker to Leo (id = sticker id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shop/sell
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": "sticker", "id": "3" }

### Sell a quiz item back (id = item key)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shop/sell
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": "item", "id": "fifty" }

### Admin: every shop price, limit and switch (+ quiz item prices, energy, pack size)
GET {{$dotenv BE_BASE_URL}}/admin/fun/shop-config
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

###
PUT {{$dotenv BE_BASE_URL}}/admin/fun/shop-config
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "enabled": true, "numbers": { "energy_price": 12, "chest_normal_price": 30 }, "quizNumbers": { "energy_max": 30, "pack_size": 10 } }
